:"2026-07-25T03:23:08.107Z"},{"platformId":"17903158086305085","profilePlatformId":"71552422756","profileHandle":"nilkpickleball","content":"Absolutely love this! We know where we’ll be spending our evenings… 😍❤️","likesCount":0,"repliesCount":0,"publishedAt":"2026-07-23T18:14:41.000Z","createdAt":"2026-07-25T03:23:08.107Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-25T03:23:08.107Z"},{"platformId":"17974847772080527","profilePlatformId":"5392614504","profileHandle":"karasik_13","content":"🔥❤️😍","likesCount":0,"repliesCount":0,"publishedAt":"2026-07-23T17:51:12.000Z","createdAt":"2026-07-25T03:23:08.107Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-25T03:23:08.107Z"},{"platformId":"18088906652428605","profilePlatformId":"3665650430","profileHandle":"jassarah26","content":"How?? totally free?m","likesCount":0,"repliesCount":0,"publishedAt":"2026-07-23T17:36:56.000Z","createdAt":"2026-07-25T03:23:08.107Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-25T03:23:08.107Z"}],"createdAt":"2026-07-24T22:13:48.666Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-20T20:08:39.371Z"},{"id":"cnt_5a213a45bd23da907ee9922eaaa7","matchedQueries":[],"platform":"instagram","profileHandle":"drmrinalibhatia","profileDisplayName":"Dr. Mrinaali | Content Creator","format":"video","caption":"If you’re still deciding where your Onam plans are happening this year, consider this your sign to add a Sadya stop to the list. 🍃✨\n\nI went in as a North Indian with absolutely no authority on how a Sadya is supposed to be eaten 😂 but the variety here genuinely impressed me. 27 traditional preparations on one banana leaf is quite the feast, and the Pineapple Pachadi was the unexpected standout for me.\n\nThe celebration is part of Spirit of Onam, a 30-day celebration of Kerala’s harvest festival at 365 Restaurant, Novotel Dubai Al Barsha.\n\n📅 15 August – 15 September 2026\n💰 AED 59 per person\n🍃 27-dish authentic Onam Sadya\n👥 Group & corporate bookings available\n\nPlanning an office Onam celebration or getting the whole family together? You can reserve your tables by calling or WhatsApping +971 56 999 4822.\n\n📍Save this for your Onam plans and send it to your Sadya gang. ❤️\n\n#OnamInDubai #Onam2026 #OnamSadya #SadyaInDubai #DubaiMalayalis MalayalisInDubai KeralaInDubai SpiritOfOnam DubaiFoodies DubaiRestaurants DubaiEvents","captionLanguage":"en","thumbnailMediaId":"med_6e5b7ce1ed4f635e3b5db2092ae5","publishedAt":"2026-08-26T05:37:16.000Z","profileId":"prf_d4f46bb2d6ee59c46a3daef880f2","thumbnailMediaUrl":"https://oriane-contents.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Db5sA0FIOV1/thumbnail.webp","viewsCount":48840,"likesCount":207,"sharesCount":364,"commentsCount":0,"interactionsCount":571,"engagementRatePerViews":1.1691236691236693,"engagementRatePerFollowers":1.093178641854766,"profileFollowersCount":52233,"profileFollowingCount":7839,"profilePostsCount":783,"mediaCount":1,"duration":27.072,"hashtags":["#onamindubai","#onam2026","#onamsadya","#sadyaindubai","#dubaimalayalis"],"coAuthors":[{"id":null,"platformId":null,"profileHandle":"desitalentnetwork"},{"id":null,"platformId":null,"profileHandle":"karaksocial"},{"id":"prf_e4dc0944d23c3a38a01de329ee3e","platformId":"62833934627","profileHandle":"tribe.creators"},{"id":null,"platformId":null,"profileHandle":"novoteldubai"}],"mentions":[],"platformId":"Db5sA0FIOV1","profilePlatformId":"49616626737","profilePictureUrl":"https://oriane-handles.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/drmrinalibhatia/pfp.webp","profileBio":"🇺🇲🇦🇪🇴🇲🇮🇳🇪🇬\nLiving, filming & reviewing the world 🎥✨\nFood 🍔 | Lifestyle 🌴 \nReviews ⭐ | Hidden Gems 📍\nFollow for real reviews & best finds 👀\nAP 7505707","profileVerified":false,"locationPlatformId":"111070818917271","locationCompleteAddress":"Dubai, United Arab Emirates","locationLatitude":25.1994,"locationLongitude":55.2741,"profileLocationPlatformId":null,"profileLocationCompleteAddress":null,"profileLocationLatitude":null,"profileLocationLongitude":null,"transcript":"Is this Dubai's best Onam sadhya? Well, Onam is less than 30 days away and I'm sure you're already looking for the best spots to celebrate with friends and family. Well, this sadhya has 27 traditional dishes from avial to rice, sambar, rasam and of course payasam. But out of everything I tried, the pineapple pachadi was hands down my favourite. Yes, I'm still learning how to eat sadhya with my hands, but hands or spoon, this was honestly one of the best experiences I've had as a North Indian.","transcriptLanguage":"en","transcriptChunks":[{"startSeconds":0.007,"endSeconds":2.227,"text":"Is this Dubai's best Onam sadhya?"},{"startSeconds":2.227,"endSeconds":8.207,"text":"Well, Onam is less than 30 days away and I'm sure you're already looking for the best spots to celebrate with friends and family."},{"startSeconds":8.207,"endSeconds":15.847,"text":"Well, this sadhya has 27 traditional dishes from avial to rice, sambar, rasam and of course payasam."},{"startSeconds":15.847,"endSeconds":20.067,"text":"But out of everything I tried, the pineapple pachadi was hands down my favourite."},{"startSeconds":20.067,"endSeconds":27.067,"text":"Yes, I'm still learning how to eat sadhya with my hands, but hands or spoon, this was honestly one of the best experiences I've had as a North Indian."}],"frames":[{"id":"med_99f9e546ea3860a1c1eb2ffd9af4","position":1,"timestampSeconds":0.43,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Db5sA0FIOV1/1_0.43.webp"},{"id":"med_5c80531a9f3ff41e676edbe308ba","position":2,"timestampSeconds":0.6,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Db5sA0FIOV1/2_0.60.webp"},{"id":"med_d5586dc0e92dc5c1c65cbe282262","position":3,"timestampSeconds":0.77,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Db5sA0FIOV1/3_0.77.webp"},{"id":"med_99e82a3d50b28f70f3288aa8200a","position":4,"timestampSeconds":0.93,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/instagram/Db5sA0FIOV1/4_0.93.webp"},{"id":"med_9b103ecb924569556c6dc7f893ca","position":5,"timestampSeconds":1.1,"url":"https://oriane-frames.s3.us-east-1.amazona